 TO TASTE GREAT</p></span></div><div data-rid="1cbcddc2-8373-42a6-8283-ad219842e523" class="r-ci3o4d alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><em>We believe you shouldn't suffer through anything. Healthy can (and should) taste great.</em></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="00c9f7d8-425b-4f32-986e-42988ab633f8" class="r-8sgws0"><picture data-rid="a0a4412c-12b3-4d4d-b8cf-c5f73c300f72" class="r-1xxeawi"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d4cd737f-4038-4ccc-bf23-4e278ca1f47d/a62c3dbe-fe62-4347-9c32-f49e4c318e48?width=96" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d4cd737f-4038-4ccc-bf23-4e278ca1f47d/a62c3dbe-fe62-4347-9c32-f49e4c318e48?width=96" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d4cd737f-4038-4ccc-bf23-4e278ca1f47d/a62c3dbe-fe62-4347-9c32-f49e4c318e48?width=96" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d4cd737f-4038-4ccc-bf23-4e278ca1f47d/a62c3dbe-fe62-4347-9c32-f49e4c318e48" class="r-15xfhd0" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="8af3a24d-bd7b-4fcb-baf5-852a8c10b155" class="r-kfmqnd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>NUTRITIONIST SUPPORT</p></span></div><div data-rid="a7d1d478-0480-47ad-b698-694404ccd362" class="r-5qjqx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>You’re never on your own—our nutritionist is here to support you with expert guidance.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="52d3ade6-f041-483e-ade1-2521ceb5bb41" class="r-8h4vfu"><div data-rid="bf5e2101-6900-4aad-a6f3-5c46731b9bea" class="r-u866uz"><div data-rid="a31949ca-19de-408a-a11f-d920969bcda6" class="r-ljh5ud"><div data-rid="cf2862f6-e33e-4b61-9bd4-839da7bc236e" class="r-11spgoh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Frequently asked Questions</p></span></div><div data-rid="2115a0d2-c0f5-43c6-88d9-571c71b18856" class="r-13a1ccg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Your questions answered here</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="329ce151-933b-4f12-9e97-b33e451f828d" class="r-18ryhwb" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="6f735088-9264-49b8-8dcb-842040117406" class="r-11ua285" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="427daf1f-3c0f-4bc2-ae56-ec72433249ce" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3c32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-w0ggvk"><div data-rid="7d22d5c6-7ef0-4d71-9524-23e4bae09011" class="r-12k5d0r alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's the best way to thaw your juices and smoothies?</p></span></div><div data-rid="bfd5264f-4d29-4439-9b50-6a905e087e26" class="r-1norb4r"><div data-rid="efa15904-3c04-4d69-82a4-28683eb506e1" class="r-qfuz3n" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1tjh4cs" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3c32:"><div data-rid="23712535-2a34-479f-8795-83b22ad82485" class="r-wzamya"><div data-rid="3c8da1c4-e468-46d3-b687-d204160fb745" class="r-1ma41i0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Your bottles should arrive frozen. Store the bottles in your freezer until you are ready to start drinking them. Thaw out the number of bottles you plan on drinking each day by putting them in your refrigerator. Thawing may take 24-48 hours depending on how cold your refridgerator is. Once thawed, bottles should remain refrigerated and be consumed within 24 hours.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="49278774-c528-441a-9aad-5fbe3b44abf2" class="r-q4p5pk" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="cb6d1832-25d1-48d1-864a-18ec6e361340" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5c32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1bpykpe"><div data-rid="74ab47f3-39b9-4f5a-abb9-4bc1bd8a75cd" class="r-mqcmlp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I leave the juices at room temperature?</p></span></div><div data-rid="cb35f2fb-4c48-4a27-92cf-f6c23e38a1da" class="r-1rak2bn"><div data-rid="23c7d89e-1f24-41f8-921f-5a4b0be07f56" class="r-h92tcp" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-184jpi9" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R5c32:"><div data-rid="adbe49a9-0c59-43b7-af4c-c4853a0d224c" class="r-di1iu6"><div data-rid="4a29fca0-ff43-461f-b731-ad9dfb83a6bd" class="r-4tau5i alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>No, our products need to be kept frozen until you are ready to consume them because they have a very short shelf life. Thaw the bottles in the refrigerator. Thawing may take up to 48 hours depending on how cold your refrigerator is. Once completely thawed our products must be consumed within 24 hours. Our juices taste best when consumed very cold. Shake bottles before you consume.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="46f1bb2c-84c6-4fec-bb78-2384a6330d5a" class="r-ta28yd" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="33219c45-aa15-41d1-a0c0-e0861efd5e79" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7c32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-b0qeey"><div data-rid="80ba0dd5-6b08-401e-8e8b-16f68405eb03" class="r-19zfxpp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I eat full meals while following a method program?</p></span></div><div data-rid="afd08ee1-639d-4e76-a96c-5e8c49f18fe3" class="r-1mtx9hv"><div data-rid="a9bbaa4b-9ab5-45c1-86f9-4fd6d137bd3f" class="r-smkqtb" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-dh7t84" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R7c32:"><div data-rid="14174b16-4e9f-4401-9efa-02daa997a140" class="r-87paks"><div data-rid="dbc9a1e4-62ce-40bd-b28e-5a3e9417364a" class="r-n4dd9h alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Absolutely, you will be eating meals with these method programs. In addition to the juices, smoothies, and functional shots, you’ll receive easy-to-follow healthy eating tips from our in-house nutritionist and clear guidance for meals and snacks. You’ll learn how to eat in a way that supports weight loss, energy, and well-being.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f05b0f75-c0d1-465c-af96-41926ffa302e" class="r-1wnv1mk" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c3e9429c-5e58-400c-92ef-8bc318e478c3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9c32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-homb5i"><div data-rid="8ff29f02-73c1-4e73-b2a4-19e5a39defc7" class="r-1g2ycun alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Why do you ship the product frozen?</p></span></div><div data-rid="5602af33-e775-447b-9cc7-ad55b95f052d" class="r-1u93c0p"><div data-rid="3c7196aa-e142-4c4e-ac1e-d50527ca2b3d" class="r-1ot0a9s" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1mi6jtq" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R9c32:"><div data-rid="2061077a-d31c-46c9-b6e5-26f54c8d1d4c" class="r-2wgkj0"><div data-rid="7eb90bcb-8684-44b2-a15c-41830d5285b4" class="r-1awwbpz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>It's the only way to truly preserve and lock in flavor, nutrients, and enzymes. Other brands essentially cook out all these good things with their processing methods. Not us. This is as close to juicing at home as you will get. And even better, because you don't have to do any work. And the fact that they arrive frozen means you can enjoy them whenever you want... no more rushing to drink them before they go bad.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4cb87131-713f-44ed-a44b-e26ad1ddd96c" class="r-1dv5sr3" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="1c5712af-b3e2-4cad-b257-ac69f722f981" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbc32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-4kyv49"><div data-rid="4bb23308-e5aa-4560-a599-a7afd8a477e2" class="r-7w7u6t alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How long does delivery take?</p></span></div><div data-rid="24d19061-3621-42a7-831d-0d6ec2b5c293" class="r-38mh09"><div data-rid="8ff980f0-a539-41c8-9bfe-a34ec3be948a" class="r-qq2tgw" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1gswv4" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rbc32:"><div data-rid="1c23e594-3273-476d-84ae-f12f9404d18e" class="r-uiraxs"><div data-rid="d40efd36-9576-4ffc-9e64-fa41fe2f292f" class="r-7i0i5j alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Generally, shipping takes 1-3 business days.&nbsp;However, this does not take into account time to process the order, and where you live in the country might affect the delivery time. We are based in New Jersey and we process orders first come, first serve. All orders are shipped Monday - Friday. If you order later in the week and there are not enough days in transit to allow for the package to arrive by Friday (commercial address) or Saturday (home delivery), your order will be held for shipment until the following week.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b72c6aef-de3c-426c-957e-2ca16b884773" class="r-106qww7" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3bf4347e-be06-430d-b8af-47ff25df5ff2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rdc32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-gdnnye"><div data-rid="9c2be349-a164-487e-a458-d343c67bbda0" class="r-davnv8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I find your juices in stores?</p></span></div><div data-rid="659a24ad-f2f0-42b4-aeba-bc7c19adb144" class="r-15klfcn"><div data-rid="770767d7-8307-49d2-83ac-a85538cecdd9" class="r-21z9w3" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-pikge7" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rdc32:"><div data-rid="23d6aaad-9719-4739-a398-